   - SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS & SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS: Highlight directional asymmetry.  
   - KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS & KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS: Capture shape extremities.  
